  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar Earthquake 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 28 March 2025, at 12:50 local time, an earthquake with of a magnitude of 7.7 on the Ritcher Scale was recorded in Myanmar. The epicenter, at a depth of 10 km, was located about 16 km north-north-west of Sagaing city, and 19 km north-west of Mandalay city, Myanmar&#x2019;s second largest. Strong tremors were also felt in Thailand, and Yunnan Province, China. Myanmar has experienced at least 13 aftershocks, with registered magnitudes between 4.3 to 6.7.</narrative>
  </description>
