   <value currency="CHF" value-date="2025-08-07">89312</value>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">A total of 89,312 CHF will be contributed to the IFRC Myanmar Earthquake appeal to support two positions.
3-Month CEA Surge Deployment
Based in Kuala Lumpur, between 29 March to 22 July 2025,48,380.86 CHF will be allocated.
50- day Recovery Consultancy
Based in Yangon, between the dates of 29 March to 31 December, 40,731.32 CHF will be allocated.
The remaining 200 CHF will cover the financial reports. The timeframe in which funds can be spent is 29 March 2025 to 31 December 2025. The full timeframe for this grant agreement is 29 March 2025 &#x2013; 30 September 2026 to align with the dates under the pledge, with includes the grant for the Senior CEA Officer.</narrative>
   </description>
