   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRC has agreed to contribute to the IFRC Myanmar Earthquake EQ response through contributing 45,259 CHF to support a Senior CEA Officer role. This role will be funded by a split of 50% BRC emergency appeal funds, and Asia Movement Coordination Budget (BU265 P7946, and 54560 P9389). The Senior CEA Officer position will be based in the Asia Pacific Regional Office, for 15 months and 50% of the role&apos;s time will be dedicated to CEA in Myanmar. 200 CHF will cover the financial reports.</narrative>
   </description>
